description:
I really do love merchandising work but today's job was a doozy, not just resetting product but also taking down and replacing shelving removing dozens of jars, boxing items up and labeling, and carting over stock items up. It was a lot but en entire Gondala and end cap done in 5 hours not bad. 
@Fritos @Frito-Lay Shop 
#fritolay #merchandiser #xybxca
